x 3 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹1,230</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">2 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹1,490</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">3 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹2,010</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">4 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹2,530</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">5 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹3,050</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">6 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹3,570</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-[5.5rem] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-md border-2 px-3 py-2 text-left transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 border-line bg-surface text-ink hover:border-graphite-light\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold leading-tight\">8 x 4 ft</span><span class=\"tabular text-caption leading-tight max-sm:text-[0.75rem] text-muted\">₹4,610</span></button></div><p class=\"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Non-standard sizes are made to order — ask Plusmark for a price.</p></fieldset><p class=\"pt-2 text-[0.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Demo price — not a Plusmark quotation.<!-- --> <!-- -->Sizes outside the published range are made to order.<!-- --> Eco Regular series.</p></div></div><aside id=\"buy-box\" class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-4 shadow-card sm:gap-5 sm:p-6 md:col-start-2 md:row-start-2 xl:col-start-3 xl:row-start-1 xl:sticky xl:top-52 xl:self-start\" aria-label=\"Buy this board\"><div><p class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\"><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">From</span><span class=\"tabular inline-flex items-baseline font-display font-bold leading-none text-ink text-[2rem]\"><span class=\"text-body-sm\">₹</span><span>580</span><sup class=\"text-[0.6em] font-semibold text-muted max-sm:hidden\">.<!-- -->00</sup></span><span class=\"text-body-sm text-muted\">+ GST</span></p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-subtle/70 p-3 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed sm:p-4 sm:text-body-sm\"><p class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">Pan-India dispatch</span> from the Ahmedabad works. Freight and the delivery date are confirmed by the order desk for your PIN code.<!-- --> <a class=\"font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary\" href=\"/policies/shipping\">Shipping details</a></span></p><p class=\"mt-2 pl-[1.625rem] text-muted\">Free pickup from the Ahmedabad works.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 pl-[1.625rem] text-caption text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin size-3.5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Delivering to <strong class=\"font-semibold text-ink\">your PIN code</strong></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"font-medium text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline\">· Update location</button></div></div><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-body font-semibold text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check size-4 text-success\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Select a size</p><p class=\"mt-1 pl-6 text-caption leading-relaxed text-muted\">Pick a size to see its price and availability.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"pdp-quantity\" class=\"text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink\">Quantity</label><select id=\"pdp-quantity\" class=\"h-11 min-w-[4.5rem] rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-surface px-2.5 text-body-sm text-ink transition-colors hover:border-muted focus-visible:border-primary focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/25\" aria-label=\"Quantity\"><option value=\"1\" selected=\"\">1</option><option value=\"2\">2</option><option value=\"3\">3</option><option value=\"4\">4</option><option value=\"5\">5</option><option value=\"6\">6</option><option value=\"7\">7</option><option value=\"8\">8</option><option value=\"9\">9</option><option value=\"10\">10</option></select></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"h-12 w-full rounded-md bg-primary text-body-sm font-semibold text-onprimary shadow-card transition-colors hover:bg-primary-strong\">Buy Now</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"h-12 w-full rounded-md border border-line-strong bg-surface text-body-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-subtle\">Add to cart</button><p class=\"text-center text-caption text-muted\">Total for <!-- -->1<!-- -->: <span class=\"tabular font-semibold text-ink\">₹580</span> + GST</p></div><dl class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-3 gap-y-2 rounded-xl bg-subtle/70 p-3 text-[0.75rem] sm:p-4 sm:text-caption\"><dt class=\"text-muted\">Ships from</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Plusmark, Ahmedabad</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">Sold by</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Plusmark Boards</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">GST invoice</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">With HSN</dd><dt class=\"text-muted\">Payment</dt><dd class=\"text-right text-ink\">Demo checkout — no real payment</dd></dl><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 text-caption font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-page lg:h-9 text-muted hover:text-ink\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg>Add to wishlist</button><a class=\"-my-2 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center text-caption font-medium text-muted underline decoration-line-strong underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-ink lg:my-0 lg:min-h-0\" href=\"/contact\">Ask about this board</a></div><p class=\"text-[0.75rem] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Demo price — not a Plusmark quotation. Prices, stock and GST are confirmed by the order desk for the exact size and quantity.<!-- --> </p></aside></div></div><div class=\"pm-shell !max-w-[90rem] pb-2 pt-6\"><div class=\"sticky z-40 hidden bg-surface transition-shadow lg:block\" style=\"top:175px\"><div class=\"relative border-b border-line\"><nav aria-label=\"Product information sections\" class=\"relative flex overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar\"><a href=\"#pdp-description\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Description</a><a href=\"#pdp-features\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Key Features</a><a href=\"#pdp-specs\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Specifications</a><a href=\"#pdp-sizes\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Sizes &amp; SKUs</a><a href=\"#pdp-care\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Care &amp; Delivery</a><a href=\"#pdp-applications\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Applications</a><a href=\"#customer-reviews\" class=\"relative flex h-[52px] shrink-0 items-center px-3.5 text-[0.8125rem] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-primary font-medium text-muted hover:text-ink\">Customer reviews</a></nav><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-surface to-transparent sm:hidden\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-6 bg-gradient-to-l from-surface to-transparent sm:hidden\"></span></div></div><details open=\"\" id=\"pdp-description\" aria-labelledby=\"pdp-description-heading\" data-reveal-id=\"pdp-description\" class=\"group py-3 lg:py-7 opacity-0\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:227px\"><summary class=\"flex min-h-12 list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden lg:pointer-events-none lg:min-h-0\"><h2 id=\"pdp-description-heading\" class=\"font-display text-[1.125rem] font-extrabold leading-6 text-ink lg:text-h2 lg:leading-[1.15]\">Description</h2><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-5 shrink-0 text-muted transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"grid gap-6 pt-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_20rem] lg:items-start lg:gap-10 lg:pt-5 xl:gap-16\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"relative\"><div id=\"pdp-description-body\" class=\"max-w-reading space-y-3 overflow-hidden text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.7] text-ink-soft transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-out pretty motion-reduce:transition-none\"><p>The Eco Regular Magnetic Board has a resin-coated writing surface in white and green variants. It supports basic magnetic accessories.</p><p>A lightweight aluminium frame with standard plastic corners keeps it easy to handle, and the functional writing surface covers basic requirements. It is the economical option in the range, designed for light usage.</p><p>Standard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.</p><p>Prices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.</p></div></div><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-factory size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M17 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h1\"></path><path d=\"M7 18h1\"></path></svg>Made to order</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg>Order a single board</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-receipt-text size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 2v20l2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1 2-1 2 1V2l-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1-2-1-2 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 8H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 12H8\"></path><path d=\"M13 16H8\"></path></svg>GST invoice</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-primary-soft px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium leading-none text-primary-strong\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>Free Ahmedabad pickup</li></ul></div><aside aria-labelledby=\"pdp-glance-heading\" class=\"lg:sticky\" style=\"top:247px\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line bg-primary-soft/60 px-4 py-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info size-4 shrink-0 text-primary-strong\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><h3 id=\"pdp-glance-heading\" class=\"font-display text-body font-bold text-ink\">At a glance</h3></div><dl class=\"divide-y divide-line\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 px-4 py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg><dt class=\"col-start-2 text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted\">Surface</dt><dd class=\"col-start-2 mt-0.5 text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink-soft\">Resin coated writing surface (white and green variants)</dd></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 px-4 py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-frame mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"2\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg><dt class=\"col-start-2 text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted\">Frame</dt><dd class=\"col-start-2 mt-0.5 text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink-soft\">Lightweight aluminium frame</dd></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 px-4 py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-magnet mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 15-4-4 6.75-6.77a7.79 7.79 0 0 1 11 11L13 22l-4-4 6.39-6.36a2.14 2.14 0 0 0-3-3L6 15\"></path><path d=\"m5 8 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m12 15 4 4\"></path></svg><dt class=\"col-start-2 text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted\">Magnetic</dt><dd class=\"col-start-2 mt-0.5 text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink-soft\">Yes</dd></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 px-4 py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-columns2 mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path></svg><dt class=\"col-start-2 text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted\">Sides</dt><dd class=\"col-start-2 mt-0.5 text-[0.875rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink-soft\">Single side</dd></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-start gap-x-3 px-4 py-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ruler mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l