Type\":\"ceramic\",\"surfaceKind\":\"marker\",\"usage\":\"Institutional white board (marker) or chalk board use\",\"blurb\":\"Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board: Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface · Aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board has a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface, available as a white board for marker writing or a chalk board for chalk writing. The hard, non-porous surface suits continuous writing and frequent cleaning, with consistent performance over a very long product life.\\n\\nIt is finished in an aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners. Where magnetic use is not required, the non-magnetic Eco Premium boards are a more economical alternative with similar writing performance.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel, in white board (marker) and chalk board options\",\"Product life — Designed for very long life under regular institutional use\",\"Performance — Hard, non-porous surface for continuous writing and frequent cleaning\",\"Finish — Smooth writing surface with consistent performance over time\",\"Maintenance — Easy to clean and maintain for daily classroom use\",\"Design — Aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/deluxe-standard-ceramic-board\",\"alt\":\"Deluxe Standard Ceramic Board - Deluxe Standard Whiteboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":2000,\"height\":1600,\"source\":\"product\"