 on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Resin coated writing surface in white and green options\",\"Magnetic use — Suitable for standard magnetic accessories\",\"Design — Aluminium frame with Electroplated Chrome Corners\",\"Finish — Smooth surface for daily classroom or office writing\",\"Build — Balanced construction for regular use\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"alt\":\"Deluxe Standard Magnetic Board - Deluxe Standard Whiteboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":2000,\"height\":1600,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-WHI-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-WHI-4X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"4-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"4 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":122},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3240,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board--5-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-magnetic-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-WHI-5X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"5-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"5 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":152},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3900,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock