30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"eco-premium-white-board\",\"slug\":\"eco-premium-white-board\",\"name\":\"Eco Premium White Board\",\"categoryId\":\"white-boards\",\"seriesId\":\"eco-premium\",\"subcategoryIds\":[\"white-boards-non-magnetic\"],\"surface\":\"High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet\",\"frame\":\"Ribbed aluminium anodized frame\",\"corners\":\"ABS Dual-Tone corners\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"non-magnetic\",\"surfaceKind\":\"marker\",\"usage\":\"Schools, institutes and corporate environments\",\"blurb\":\"Eco Premium White Board: High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet · Ribbed aluminium anodized frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Eco Premium White Board pairs premium-grade materials with a High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet for enhanced durability. Its ABS Dual-Tone Corner Design adds strength and a refined appearance.\\n\\nThe smooth, high-gloss surface gives a seamless writing experience. It is made for schools, institutes and corporate environments, and is reliable and long-lasting for daily institutional use.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 2 x 3 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Premium-grade materials with High Gloss Marker Grade HPL Sheet\",\"Design — ABS Dual-Tone Corner Design for added strength and refined appearance\",\"Surface — Smooth, high-gloss surface for a seamless writing experience\",\"Durability — Reliable and long-lasting for daily institutional use\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/eco-premium-white-board\",\"alt\":\"Eco Pr