rs is easy to handle and install.\\n\\nThe High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface suits basic writing needs. It is ideal for home offices, tuition classes and small classrooms, and is good for light, budget-friendly use.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Cost-effective, regular materials\",\"Design — Lightweight frame with standard plastic corners, easy to handle and install\",\"Surface — High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface suitable for basic writing needs\",\"Durability — Good for light use and budget-friendly applications\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-regular-white-board--1-x-1-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-WHI-1X1FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"1-x-1-ft\",\"label\":\"1 x 1 ft\",\"widthCm\":30,\"heightCm\":30},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-white-board--1-x-1-ft--pack-2\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-WHI-1X1FT0-P2\",\"size\":\"$23:2:props:related:4:variants:0:size\",\"priceMode\":\"on_request\",\"priceInr\":null,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null,\"packQty\":2},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-white-board--1-x-1-ft--pack-4\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-WHI-1X1FT0-P4\",\"size\":\"$23:2:props:related:4:variants:0:size\",\"priceMode\":\"on_request\",\"priceInr\":null,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInve