"heightCm\":152},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3050,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-white-board--6-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-WHI-6X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"6-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"6 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":183},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":3570,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-white-board--8-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-white-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-WHI-8X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"8-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"8 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":244},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":4610,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null}],\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"gstRatePercent\":12,\"hsnCode\":null,\"minimumOrderQuantity\":1,\"bulkSuggestionQuantity\":10,\"specs\":[{\"label\":\"Type\",\"value\":\"Non-Magnetic White Board\"},{\"label\":\"Material\",\"value\":\"Cost-effective, regular materials\"},{\"label\":\"Design\",\"value\":\"Lightweight frame with standard plastic corners, easy to handle and install\"},{\"label\":\"Surface\",\"value\":\"High Gloss Melamine Writing Surface suitable for basic writing needs\"},{\"label\":\"Durability\",\"value\":\"Good for light use and budget-friendly applications\"}],\"enquiryOnly\":false,\"needsData\":false,\"published\":true,\"featured\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-01T09:30:00.000Z\"},{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-board\",\"slug\":\"metallic-premium-ceramic-board\",\"name\":\"Metallic Premium Ceramic Board\",\"categoryId\":\"white-boards\",\"seriesId\":\"metallic-premium\",\"subcategoryIds\":[\"white-boards-ceramic\"],\"surface\":\"Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface\",\"frame\":\"Aluminium frame\",\"corners\":\"Signature Dual-Tone corners - red cap over black connector\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"ceramic\",\"surfaceKind\":\"marker\",\"usage\":\"Institutional white board (marker) or chalk board use\",\"blurb\":\"Metallic Premium Ceramic Board: Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface · Aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Metallic Premium Ceramic Board has a ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel surface, available as a white board for marker writing or a chalk board for chalk writing. The hard, non-porous surface is made for continuous writing and frequent cleaning, with consistent performance over a very long product life.\\n\\nIt is finished in an aluminium frame with Signature Dual-Tone Corners. Where magnetic use is not required, the non-magnetic Metallic Premium boards are a more economical alternative with similar writing performance.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Surface — Ceramic steel / porcelain enamel steel, in white board (marker) and chalk board options\",\"Product life — Designed for very long life under regular institutional use\",\"Performance — Hard, non-porous surface for continuous writing and frequent cleaning\",\"Finish — Smooth writing surface with consistent performance over time\",\"Maintenance — Easy to clean and maintain for daily classroom use\",\"Design — Aluminium frame with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-ceramic-board\",\"alt\":\"Metallic Premium Ceramic Board - Metallic Premium Whiteboard by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,